Package: win11-panel
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt5
Recommends: network-manager, bluez, pulseaudio-utils, policykit-1, x11-xserver-utils, brightnessctl, usbutils, pciutils, apt
Suggests: redshift, clamav, ufw
Maintainer: Win11Panel <dev@example.com>
Description: Classic Windows Control Panel replica for Linux
 A PyQt5 application faithfully replicating the classic Windows
 Control Panel (category view, breadcrumbs, large/small icon views)
 on Linux. Controls real system features via nmcli, bluetoothctl,
 pactl, xrandr, systemctl, timedatectl and apt: system & security,
 network, hardware & sound, programs, user accounts, personalization,
 clock & region, ease of access, device manager and admin tools.
